  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut sweet potato into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place potato on the lined oven tray. Sprinkle with garlic & herb seasoning. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt.\n• Toss to coat, spread out evenly and roast until tender, 20-25 mins. Set aside to cool.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4cc588fc37702f5b7aeaba/step-77b77500.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice brown onion.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook onion, stirring until softened, 5-6 mins.\n• Reduce heat to medium, then add the balsamic vinegar, water and brown sugar. Cook, until sticky, 3-5 mins. Transfer to a small bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4cc588fc37702f5b7aeaba/step-5829d610.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, roughly chop tomato and cucumber.\n• Pat haloumi dry, then slice into 1cm-thick slices.\n• Wipe out pan and return to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 mins each side. Transfer to a plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4cc588fc37702f5b7aeaba/step-97215320.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large bowl, combine tomato, cucumber, roasted sweet potato, salad leaves and a drizzle of balsamic vinegar and olive oil. Toss to coat and season to taste.\n• Divide salad between bowls.\n• Top with caramelised onion and haloumi to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4cc588fc37702f5b7aeaba/step-e8549130.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
